    <item name="U.S. International Trade in Goods and Services">
      <dbId>102</dbId>
      <title>U.S. International Trade in Goods and Services, September 2026</title>
      <link>https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/us-international-trade-goods-and-services-september-2026</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/us-international-trade-goods-and-services-september-2026</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The U.S. goods and services trade deficit decreased in September 2026 according to the U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis and the U.S. Census Bureau. The deficit decreased from $105.7 billion in August (revised) to $105.0 billion in September, as exports increased more than imports. The goods deficit decreased $0.7 billion in September to $135.9 billion. The services surplus decreased less than $0.1 billion in September to $30.9 billion.</p>]]></description>
